OL,3,CSecond homes: Welsh Government
OL,4,Cconsiders change to holiday let tax
OL,5,Cpolicy
OL,7,FThe Welsh Government has announced it
OL,8,Fis considering reducing the 182-day
OL,9,Fthreshold for holiday lets to be
OL,10,Fexempt from additional council tax.
OL,12,FSince April 2023, self-catering
OL,13,Fproperties have been subject to non-
OL,14,Fdomestic rates rather than council tax
OL,15,Fif they are available to let for at
OL,16,Fleast 252 days and actually let for at
OL,17,Fleast 182 days.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G1/5
