OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F438A1785687480
OL,3,CSecond homes: Welsh Government
OL,4,Cconsiders change to holiday let tax
OL,5,Cpolicy
OL,7,FThe government has announced a 12-week
OL,8,Fconsultation on the law, including
OL,9,Fconsidering reducing the 182-day
OL,10,Fthreshold.
OL,12,FThe consultation will also look at
OL,13,Ffive potential new exemptions for self-
OL,14,Fcatering properties that could not
OL,15,Freasonably be used as a permanent home.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G2/5
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BWales News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,439,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43803
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F438A1785687480
OL,3,CSecond homes: Welsh Government
OL,4,Cconsiders change to holiday let tax
OL,5,Cpolicy
OL,7,FThe government says these could cover
OL,8,Fproperties that are part of a wider
OL,9,Fbusiness, large multi-unit properties,
OL,10,Fproperties subject to a relevant
OL,11,Fplanning restriction, properties
OL,12,Fwithin the curtilage of the owner's
OL,13,Fhome, and properties on the owner's
OL,14,Ffarm.
OL,16,FThe consultation aims to give
OL,17,Fbusinesses, local authorities and
OL,18,Fother stakeholders a say on the future
OL,19,Fdirection of the current policy.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G3/5
