OL,3,CSecond homes: Welsh Government
OL,4,Cconsiders change to holiday let tax
OL,5,Cpolicy
OL,7,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,8,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,9,Fcoverage from ITV Wales, sent direct
OL,10,Fto your inbox every Saturday morning.
OL,12,FCabinet Minister for Finance, Elin
OL,13,FJones said: "Our manifesto included a
OL,14,Fcommitment to keep the 182-day letting
OL,15,Fthreshold under review and create
OL,16,Fclear and reasonable new exemptions
OL,17,Fwhere self-catering accommodation
OL,18,Fwould not qualify as a private home.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G4/5
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
