PN,43805
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F438A1785687480
OL,3,CSecond homes: Welsh Government
OL,4,Cconsiders change to holiday let tax
OL,5,Cpolicy
OL,7,F"I have heard representations from a
OL,8,Fnumber of businesses that are making
OL,9,Fmeaningful contributions to their
OL,10,Flocal economies but are unable to meet
OL,11,Fthe current threshold.
OL,13,F"This consultation will help us find a
OL,14,Fsolution that works better for
OL,15,Feveryone, including businesses, local
OL,16,Fauthorities and local areas.
OL,18,F"I am committed to getting the balance
OL,19,Fright ` keeping homes in our
OL,20,Fcommunities while giving tourism the
OL,21,Fsupport it needs to thrive."
